  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s socio economic benefits are described in Section B (Project Description) and are embeded in the project&apos;s ToC diagram that will guide the project&apos;s intervetion during the implementation phase. In addition, progress indicators are described in Appendix 3 Logical Framework to ensure that there will be adequate monitoring and reporting at MTR and TER.</narrative>
